              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakurikirwa na Meremoti mwene Uriya, Uriya wa Hakosi, mu kuhasana; na we akurikirwa na Meshulamu mwene Berekiya, Berekiya wa Meshezabeli; na we akurikirwa na Sadoki mwene Bayana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
