              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irembo rya kera ryasanwe na Yoyada mwene Paseya na Meshulamu mwene Besodeya; barishiramw’ imitambikwa yaryo, baterako n’inzugi zaryo n’ivyuma vyo kuzigumya n’ibihindizo vyazo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakurikirwa na Melatiya w’i Gibeya na Yadoni w’i Meronoti, hamwe n’ab’i Gibeya n’ab’i Misipa bo mu baganzwa n’icēgēra c’ umwami co hakuno y’uruzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakurikirwa na Uziyeli mwene Harihaya, umwe wo mu bacuzi b’izahabu; na we akurikirwa na Hananiya, umwe wo mu bahinga bazi kwinjiza imibavu; nuko basana inzitiro z’i Yerusalemu bashitsa no ku ruzitiro rw’intimba nini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakurikirwa na Refaya mwene Huri, umukuru aganza igice kimwe c’intāra y’i Yerusalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akurikirwa na Yedaya mwene Harumafu, asana aherekeye inzu yiwe; na we akurikirwa na Hatushi mwene Hashabuneya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malakiya mwene Harimu, na Hashubu mwene Pahati‐mowabu, basana ikindi gice, bo n’umunara wo ku matanure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akurikirwa na Shalumu mwene Haloheshi, umukuru aganza ikindi gice c’i Yerusalemu nyene, na we arasana, bo n’abakobga biwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
