            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irembo rija ku mwonga ryasanwe na Hanuni bo n’abantu b’i Zanowa; bararyubaka, baterako n’inzugi zaryo n’ivyuma vyo kuzigumya n’ibihindizo vyazo, basana uruzitiro rw’amatambge igihumbi y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, bageza kw irembo ricishwamw’ umwavu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
