        },
        {
          "text": "Irembo rija kw iriba risanwa na Shalumu mwene Koli‐hoze, umukuru aganza intāra y’i Misipa, araryubaka ararisakara, ariterakw inzugi zaryo, n’ivyuma vyo kuzigumya n’ibihindizo vyazo, yubaka n’uruzitiro rwo ku kidengeri Shela",
