            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurikirakw abantu b’i Tekowa, basana ikindi gihimba kirābana n’ uwo munara munini wometseko nyene, bashitsa ku ruzitiro rw’i Ofeli.",
          "type": "text",
